"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"theanonymousone"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["glm","5",".","3"],"value":"<em>GLM-5.3</em>-Flash Intelligence, Performance and Price Analysis"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/glm-5-3-flash"}},"_tags":["story","author_theanonymousone","story_49450353"],"author":"theanonymousone","children":[49450609,49450639,49451279,49451378,49451473,49451754,49452108,49452248,49455375,49455801],"created_at":"2026-08-26T14:58:54Z","created_at_i":1787756334,"num_comments":60,"objectID":"49450353","points":139,"story_id":49450353,"title":"GLM-5.3-Flash Intelligence, Performance and Price Analysis","updated_at":"2026-09-15T07:51:24Z","url":"https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/glm-5-3-flash"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"flxflx"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["glm","5",".","3"],"value":"We found an approach to get Jev-like properties from standard LLMs like <em>GLM-5.3</em>-Flash.<p>The core idea is to craft the input prompt so that the first output token answers the question. This makes it possible to get a decision with a single forward pass.<p>In the blog post, we describe the approach in detail for <em>GLM-5.3</em>-Flash and vLLM. We benchmark this setup against Jev and Laya. We find that our setup is on-par with Jev in terms of accuracy and speed and that it substantially outperforms Laya.<p>Still, in terms of costs per decision, Jev is several x better than our setup. In turn, our setup supports vision inputs."},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["glm","5",".","3"],"value":"Turning <em>GLM-5.3</em>-Flash into a Jev-like decision model"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://www.privatemode.ai/blog/system-one-from-glm-flash"}},"_tags":["story","author_flxflx","story_49857656"],"author":"flxflx","children":[49857657,49857986,49862056,49862229,49862454,49862639,49862653,49862676,49862973,49863427,49863924,49864408,49866699,49866803,49867196,49874800],"created_at":"2026-09-26T15:49:04Z","created_at_i":1790437744,"num_comments":59,"objectID":"49857656","points":137,"story_id":49857656,"story_text":"We found an approach to get Jev-like properties from standard LLMs like GLM-5.3-Flash.<p>The core idea is to craft the input prompt so that the first output token answers the question. This makes it possible to get a decision with a single forward pass.<p>In the blog post, we describe the approach in detail for GLM-5.3-Flash and vLLM. We benchmark this setup against Jev and Laya. We find that our setup is on-par with Jev in terms of accuracy and speed and that it substantially outperforms Laya.<p>Still, in terms of costs per decision, Jev is several x better than our setup. In turn, our setup supports vision inputs.","title":"Turning GLM-5.3-Flash into a Jev-like decision model","updated_at":"2026-09-30T09:06:12Z","url":"https://www.privatemode.ai/blog/system-one-from-glm-flash"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"hkalbasi"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["glm","5",".","3"],"value":"<em>GLM-5.3</em> Uncensored"},"url":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["glm","5",".","3"],"value":"https://huggingface.co/dealignai/<em>GLM-5.3</em>-UNCENSORED-FP8"}},"_tags":["story","author_hkalbasi","story_49538856"],"author":"hkalbasi","children":[49541818],"created_at":"2026-09-02T16:39:52Z","created_at_i":1788367192,"num_comments":1,"objectID":"49538856","points":15,"story_id":49538856,"title":"GLM-5.3 Uncensored","updated_at":"2026-09-06T02:14:40Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/dealignai/GLM-5.3-UNCENSORED-FP8"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"theHocineSaad"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["glm","5",".","3"],"value":"Based on artificialanalysis.ai, Kimi K3 and <em>GLM-5.3</em> are more intelligent than the new Gemini 3.8 Flash[1][2].<p>Gemini 3.8 Flash comes in eighth place with a score of 59, just after Kimi K3 and <em>GLM-5.3</em>, with scores of 60 for both of them.<p>Gemini 3.8 Flash was better in terms of Cost per task, with $0.58 spent to finish the task, $0.68 for <em>GLM-5.3</em>, and 0.84 for Kimi K3[3][4].<p>Because results may change over time, I included screenshots taken at the time of writing this post.<p>[1] https://artificialanalysis.ai/#intelligence  \n[2] https://imgur.com/a/BMOJBED<p>[3] https://artificialanalysis.ai/#price-and-cost  \n[4] https://imgur.com/a/55sQRUZ"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["glm","5",".","3"],"value":"Kimi K3 and <em>GLM-5.3</em> are better than Gemini 3.8 Flash"}},"_tags":["story","author_theHocineSaad","story_49539315","ask_hn"],"author":"theHocineSaad","children":[49539736],"created_at":"2026-09-02T17:11:49Z","created_at_i":1788369109,"num_comments":2,"objectID":"49539315","points":11,"story_id":49539315,"story_text":"Based on artificialanalysis.ai, Kimi K3 and GLM-5.3 are more intelligent than the new Gemini 3.8 Flash[1][2].<p>Gemini 3.8 Flash comes in eighth place with a score of 59, just after Kimi K3 and GLM-5.3, with scores of 60 for both of them.<p>Gemini 3.8 Flash was better in terms of Cost per task, with $0.58 spent to finish the task, $0.68 for GLM-5.3, and 0.84 for Kimi K3[3][4].<p>Because results may change over time, I included screenshots taken at the time of writing this post.<p>[1] https:&#x2F;&#x2F;artificialanalysis.ai&#x2F;#intelligence  \n[2] https:&#x2F;&#x2F;imgur.com&#x2F;a&#x2F;BMOJBED<p>[3] https:&#x2F;&#x2F;artificialanalysis.ai&#x2F;#price-and-cost  \n[4] https:&#x2F;&#x2F;imgur.com&#x2F;a&#x2F;55sQRUZ","title":"Kimi K3 and GLM-5.3 are better than Gemini 3.8 Flash","updated_at":"2026-09-03T20:51:04Z"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"mat